            <ArticleTitle>[Unilateral hematocolpos, blind vagina and agenesis of the homolateral urinary tract].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>401-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hematocolpos with homolateral renal agenesis is a rare condition. Dysmenorrhea and paroxysmal abdominal pain are common symptoms in adolescent girls. Following a review of the literature, this article considers those procedures and investigations which can be used to help these patients before arriving at the stage of reconstructive surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
